  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDH VGC Fund III, L.P.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VGC (venture and growth capital) III aims to invest in 20-30 early-growth stage companies that operate primarily in the health care, enterprise solutions, technology, and consumer sectors that have significant business operations in the PRC. The investment in VGC III will allow the Asian Development Bank (ADB) to mobilize equity capital into the PRC to support private sector solutions in addressing developmental challenges related to an aging population and increasing disease burden, quality of growth, and climate change in the PRC.</narrative>
  </description>
